The Fixer was a demonic figure who came and went through the fountain of blood in the hall of [[Geography/The Quorum|the Quorum]] on the [[Geography/Star 221,325|Joker World at Star 221,325]], where [[Sigzil Haight]]'s servants keep their hold.

[[Org/The Scale/People/Manuel de la Cruzada|Reverend Warden Manuel de la Cruzada]] knew him by the name.

He is dead, cut down in the hall of the Quorum as he stepped out of the blood.
